  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Structure and components",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Manufacturers offer packaging choices around the deck: LongPack lists telescope, tuck, tin, magnetic-lid and deck boxes; The Game Crafter distinguishes card-only tuck/hook boxes from larger boxes intended for games with parts. These are supplier-described capabilities. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.longpackgames.com/components/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0b044770863482f5c0a209955dfaa6564715815349687ce02ad50da58c82d42c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:0c41a77a3e6aa1909ade924b22add6874cdb1ca474dfb9967cd7f5c15620e0d6",
            "ev:74b1f30607fa5db9a0a1c2b809e287e6d076ac61c5bcdd13104d50c596de95ae"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://help.thegamecrafter.com/article/83-boxes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack's telescopic-box guideline calls for at least 15mm clearance in each dimension relative to the largest component, while also requiring capacity for all components together. Its example applies the allowance to folded boards, rules and punchboards. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://help.longpackgames.com/article/58-telescopic-box",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b62b1714c0e98c75e78d68c13add32843fd359767f0bef4b1db244701a530dcf",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:550c8dd943a14b26addae0f772f69afbdcef7e8a03d011a1433914964749558f",
            "ev:9a931836bf678cc6111707cd1fd866670dab262db637955f51aea06f7a851d07"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panda requires a component specification sheet for designs that are not printed on paper. It supplies templates for printed boxes, game boards and cards. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://pandagm.com/tools/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:542c48c6dfc080e39dfbb77f30ed3998af053691711f88e5d08ea4a62d40b2e1",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:1743392a9e20a6d69a05cc9462f2961e08fb0f34606bc51b7738583f07fafa41",
            "ev:8d5023abd4e463469346a6f18c91f9fc47e13090eec71cb20cc50f6fb1b089b8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panda describes a pre-production copy covering printed box, rules, cards, punchboards and boards, accompanied by non-printed component samples. It then reviews a mass-production copy before assembling the remaining games. These are its described approval stages. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://pandagm.com/our-process/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d05fda447b61ca219f5bffc1784291bb54c81ad703c0d4ba0edd1036efe1078a",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:331fcee8de3e5ebb4a43c1bba1a2444310ec94694165870096240a7d1888fc93",
            "ev:37e7bc62838cfe35ffc66cd23bfb963bd8844f1ddf82e0393e159c035f55b226",
            "ev:4ed9b347f25dbe1ca478e1aac03948b9d24b912d4393382ef3c603654062e7a6",
            "ev:79c59d8052277c3b335be9424b0a795fd98b5d7fc7f04eab6eb2c2fc8b9972fd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PrintNinja warns that physical game proofs can include digitally printed components that are not color accurate, even though the proof arrives assembled. Approving an assembled proof therefore does not establish final color matching for those components. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://printninja.com/proofing-options/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:59a9fddea83c9143a20ad2ade1dce293a21b7917fa997dc4b8b6616c7f8a3510",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:11cbb61405840cb7bd5c21e110b0eff041260fea014659209089e56dabe3d66a",
            "ev:b29ad7b51da3b96446f33e5d4534be4fed31ad5e4359d54033d9435e57d5f9ce"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Game Crafter says components that do not fit the selected game box can be packed outside that box in the shipping carton, potentially increasing shipping charges. A completed order therefore need not mean all components fit the retail box. (low confidence) (verified as of 2020-12-30)",
          "source": "https://help.thegamecrafter.com/article/43-will-these-parts-fit-into-this-box",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d4d2e3adceb9a4e154dd4e2faf569ba6ccbfa52c24f8b7cf072b8caa97a31585",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:11152ec36dda15d33962051583b432149c84ac43f2e8945547ad2b2a04163d17",
            "ev:cc06f21e482e5c0f55d63a3246e235d3055bfc738b2198d4d31cc83f926b41ec"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panda offers folding boards and printed die-cut punchboards for tokens, tiles and other shapes; it warns that unique shapes and dual-layer mats require a die-cut mold and increase cost. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://pandagm.com/components/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d397f5f7902e93573f05820fb9c21b640288c2af92a3d4529932cebe0a0c1cbb",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:34847b4e6c4de80cfea00955eab1b6fe792772bae26969f5a8c566245c87cbe1",
            "ev:61c5bab65fc4426f2277947924dfb19c905160ade656b3e60e92a0cf16c0241d",
            "ev:b113bf76366296edcb648857d25e715451bd39e8cdcee6371fbdba2e1a2c3f81"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panda assigns a project manager from specification and pricing through production, reviews print files and component designs, then supplies a pre-production copy and nonprinted component samples for approval before mass production. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://pandagm.com/our-process/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:1a4c17da8928ebb26d4faae505d0eb1ee1b68a69f5d52a921bf8fdf15974c945",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
