          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Under its no-box packing guidance, The Game Crafter uses plastic zippered baggies for smaller noncard components and brown paper banding for cards. (low confidence) (verified as of 2023-05-22)",
          "source": "https://help.thegamecrafter.com/article/623-how-will-my-game-components-be-packed-if-i-dont-include-a-box",
          "note": null,
