        },
        {
          "text": "Looney Labs explains that its folded, single-piece printed box parts use lighter material than wrapped setup boxes, feel more flexible and cost less to make; it also says hang-tab packaging supports some mass-market releases at lower production cost. These are its own packaging choices and economics. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://faq.looneylabs.com/non-gameplay-questions/game-materials-faq",
