    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "LongPack advertises folding game boards with reinforced edges, different papers and finishes, and die-cut double-board options. This is a supplier capability statement. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.longpackgames.com/components/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:f3eaf54b629d805a2d15c78bc35c04402c59698eda975e2e3b299eda137093b6",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:e168bac3b19cc351eae7d7201e4d1ea7a6a404ff368816ea0f5fd690366e7ec6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack lists stock wooden meeples, cubes, discs and triangles plus custom wooden shapes; it describes painting and laser engraving as decoration options. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.longpackgames.com/components/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d8e9c6440e1825c07d5beded67dd6279d924720357dea96c4b1b4ff39551ec03",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:baf53a0bf154027e4646f9ef6696f3f369fa5e04aa7bbbb3acd433fc40638d4d"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack describes dice made from wood, resin or acrylic, customized through engraving, laser cutting or printing. This is a manufacturing capability statement. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.longpackgames.com/components/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:3c94dc67b1706fcd3cc3c29b65a5a73fca22f1e846da7563f8df9da54e15eeb7",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:918e955614b5e2dba6712b66ccda31f74fc9fbcfdf5ac7098c1293776bde1192"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack specifies 20mm of artwork bleed per side for telescopic-box top and bottom files: 3mm standard bleed plus 17mm wrap margin. This is its box-specific requirement. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://help.longpackgames.com/article/58-telescopic-box",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:49561c1a9bcf13c150c87988047b74ff9ca13674fb389dce8c85430bd64ade18",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:bb2344f0d22b912156a522713700c10ec022c9434346fb908443ddbcdada7f79"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PrintNinja offers shaped vacuum-formed plastic organizers and printable cardstock dividers for two-piece boxes; its stated cardstock compartment shapes are squares or rectangles. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://printninja.com/custom-board-game-organizers/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:6ef8fceb074badfd95b79933f885af89181cf588fcc1285e3db4f3b91e4ae780",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:6fae03de7ab0962eebd814904a68367eefcbdcf9fa39fe7f620dfdd8107d67ef",
            "ev:72659fd855840aa4eebb3d6e5ae58604cd489bb9e14731ebf8aa3e854dd3d88b",
            "ev:b220eb3b317b9d6896b65ac27b2e0c42ce6f8bf860422a5a435908b100314e3a",
            "ev:e1f397f0673631825fdf01a1e6eac1c9f294c22f39ae525cc19f77b9cb75d8c7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack's punchboard guide specifies approximately 8mm x 8mm as its smallest token size, a minimum 3mm edge on custom shapes, and at least 6mm between dielines. These are supplier-specific design limits. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://help.longpackgames.com/article/63-punchboard",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:15516d3c3bf691fa8fc106606c32ec3462702b787c9be69088b0b76ff5f54e4f",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:03827e47e7e749c8d7a9f4f27c79dd1cd400348ffe7f2e7a49fcad1f1a8c7e5e",
            "ev:f8388e36b52f1713d04e532d5a8f9bdaedacdecee2c4145aa5f4777785bfdbe9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack instructs designers to separate punchboard dielines from regular artwork and mirror the back-side layout. It also recommends identifying similar diecut molds with marks or numbers to prevent mixing. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://help.longpackgames.com/article/63-punchboard",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:17a1f2ae2b3758fb47f5c58f739ce49885c784bcc0da2630039d8ab6c652a61f",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:0f57d5a7878f5f1f9256b996d7f812164b81895789b2822eb53b30a54a4b82a5",
            "ev:3e8bbce1bd7154041ddc1194c86fc84b12b0ef6c3b4a2401dc034100764821b3",
            "ev:b92b71d59ad64b82166e9d4e3271367437c8baa294a723ecce65355f60ca118f"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack says each punchboard diecut mold adds cost and suggests reusing one dieline template across multiple punchboards where the layout permits. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://help.longpackgames.com/article/63-punchboard",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:4c3c636524642b2e76c3dafb5637fa7be8debbeac0870daac7a1b42cd49510b2",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:16d56e650f1e4ba7edd91e7cf18ab14ce847d8b4bc29ec576c91cc6e2f80c394"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PrintNinja's game-proof options include instruction sheets, accordion instructions, saddle-stitched booklets and perfect-bound booklets; its listed instruction proofs use digital printing. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://printninja.com/proofing-options/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:6f26c3106874c016cfad74645ea559ee9bfb4ac4d233db34227917b1b5134a9b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:133150aac27022b4fa4c1e2c0cd6876f5a6e7801e30ed81c12f2eb07e43fb36c"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panda offers a one-piece tuckbox for a game consisting of cards and a paper sheet, as well as internal tuckboxes for larger games; LongPack lists telescope, tuck, magnetic-lid, tin and deck boxes. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://pandagm.com/components/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:6b6f187784e6b3ddc44419dbe0f017771b9d0da9d84cff602d35fd1e9c310407",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
