          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LongPack lists stock wooden meeples, cubes and discs alongside custom shapes, with paint or laser engraving; it lists wood, resin and acrylic dice customized by engraving, laser cutting or printing. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.longpackgames.com/components/",
